#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:0
msgid ""
"Turn on simulated secondary click to right-click by holding down the left "
"mouse button, and set how long you must hold it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:7
msgid "Topics: Accessibility"
msgstr "話題：無障礙功能"

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:11
msgid "Simulate a right mouse click"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:13
msgid ""
"You can right-click by holding down the left mouse button. This is useful if "
"you find it difficult to move your fingers individually on one hand, or if "
"your pointing device only has a single button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:15
msgid "Open the Activities overview and start typing **accessibility**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:16
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Accessibility` to open the panel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:17
msgid "Open the {guilabel}`Pointing & Clicking` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:18
msgid ""
"In the {guilabel}`Click Assist` section, enable the {guilabel}`Simulated "
"Secondary Click` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:20
msgid ""
"You can change how long you must hold down the left mouse button before it "
"is registered as a right click by changing the {guilabel}`Acceptance Delay`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:22
msgid ""
"To right-click with simulated secondary click, hold down the left mouse "
"button where you would normally right-click, then release. The pointer fills "
"with a different color as you hold down the left mouse button. Once it will "
"change this color entirely, release the mouse button to right-click."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:24
msgid ""
"Some special pointers, such as the resize pointers, do not change colors. "
"You can still use simulated secondary click as normal, even if you do not "
"get visual feedback from the pointer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:26
msgid ""
"If you use {ref}`Mouse Keys <click-and-move-the-mouse-pointer-using-the-"
"keypad>`, this also allows you to right-click by holding down the {kbd}`5` "
"key on your keypad."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/simulate-a-right-mouse-click.md:29
msgid ""
"In the Activities overview, you are always able to long-press to right-"
"click, even with this feature disabled. Long-press works slightly "
"differently in the overview: you do not have to release the button to right-"
"click."
msgstr ""
